      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Good morning. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Hi. I have an appointment for a haircut at ten. My name's Dina."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Let me check. I have you here for Wednesday at ten, not today."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Wednesday? Are you sure? I booked it on the phone on Monday, and the text message says Tuesday at ten."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Oh, I see. I'm sorry, it looks like we typed the wrong day."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "That's okay, but I really need it today. I have to be at work at twelve. Is anyone free this morning?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "A stylist is free at ten forty. It takes about forty-five minutes. Or there's another free appointment at one thirty."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "One thirty doesn't work, because I'll be at work. If I start at ten forty, I'll finish at about eleven thirty, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Yes, at about eleven twenty-five."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Great, I'll wait. Could you also cancel the Wednesday appointment, please?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Of course. Ten forty today, and Wednesday is canceled. Would you like a coffee while you wait?"
    }
